# your API keys and your chats: never on GitHub
.env
# everything in Conversations/, except its README. (git can't bring a file back from an ignored folder, so the
# folder's contents are ignored instead of the folder itself)
Conversations/*
!Conversations/README.md

# python's cache files
__pycache__/

# what the agents make in Shared Folder (Common and the projects): yours, not GitHub's. only the notebook engine and
# the README are part of the program, so they stay
Shared Folder/*
!Shared Folder/Notebook_Engine/
!Shared Folder/README.md
